<title>USA: Dura Automotive Systems Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Dura Automotive Systems Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.39		   $ 0.32</p>
<p> Net			  3,428		    2,794</p>
<p> Revs			60,842		   59,434</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,839		    8,826</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results are pro forma. The company had its initial public offering on August 14, 1996 and divested its window regulator business in April 1995.  </p>
<p>			 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.30		    $1.10</p>
<p> Net			 11,506		    9,689</p>
<p> Revs		     245,329		  239,598</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,821		    8,784</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 and 1995 results are pro forma, giving effect to the initial public offering as if it had occurred at the beginning of the periods presented.</p>
<p>1995 full-year results give effect to the April 1, 1995 sale of the company's window regulator business as if it had occurred at the beginning of 1995.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
